{"fields":[{"t":"B","v":"false","n":"HasIntroAudio"},{"t":"A","v":"intro","n":"IntroAudio"},{"t":"B","v":"true","n":"HasPromptAudio"},{"t":"A","v":"prompt","n":"PromptAudio","s":"Quels sont les organes principaux de l'appareil digestif ?"},{"t":"B","v":"true","n":"HasClueAudio0"},{"t":"A","v":"answers_0_hint","n":"ClueAudio0","s":"More than one alcoholic beverage of this type for me!"},{"t":"B","v":"false","n":"HasClueAudio1"},{"t":"A","v":"answers_1_hint","n":"ClueAudio1"},{"t":"B","v":"true","n":"HasClueAudio2"},{"t":"A","v":"answers_2_hint","n":"ClueAudio2","s":"Your two little ear holes!"},{"t":"B","v":"true","n":"HasClueAudio3"},{"t":"A","v":"answers_3_hint","n":"ClueAudio3","s":"Lots of people have these, like being scared of spiders. Or quadrilaterals."},{"t":"B","v":"true","n":"HasClueAudio4"},{"t":"A","v":"answers_4_hint","n":"ClueAudio4","s":"These are the little things that make watches go. And wheels for that matter."},{"t":"B","v":"true","n":"HasClueAudio5"},{"t":"A","v":"answers_5_hint","n":"ClueAudio5","s":"Either your companions, OR a way you can walk over the ocean."},{"t":"B","v":"true","n":"HasClueAudio6"},{"t":"A","v":"answers_6_hint","n":"ClueAudio6","s":"These come out of your eye holes when you're sad."},{"t":"B","v":"true","n":"HasClueAudio7"},{"t":"A","v":"answers_7_hint","n":"ClueAudio7","s":"Oh, how the THESE fly by."},{"t":"B","v":"false","n":"HasClueAudio8"},{"t":"A","v":"answers_8_hint","n":"ClueAudio8"},{"t":"B","v":"true","n":"HasClueAudio9"},{"t":"A","v":"answers_9_hint","n":"ClueAudio9","s":"I'm... sort of... shaped like this."},{"t":"B","v":"false","n":"HasClueAudio10"},{"t":"A","v":"answers_10_hint","n":"ClueAudio10"},{"t":"B","v":"true","n":"HasClueAudio11"},{"t":"A","v":"answers_11_hint","n":"ClueAudio11","s":"The wheel in your car does this."},{"t":"B","v":"true","n":"HasClueAudio12"},{"t":"A","v":"answers_12_hint","n":"ClueAudio12","s":"Oh Frankie! Come look! There's a bunch of these cute antlered guys on the lawn!"},{"t":"B","v":"true","n":"HasClueAudio13"},{"t":"A","v":"answers_13_hint","n":"ClueAudio13","s":"When the creature gets closer, it does this."},{"t":"B","v":"true","n":"HasClueAudio14"},{"t":"A","v":"answers_14_hint","n":"ClueAudio14","s":"The evil villain does this with his wicked mouth."},{"t":"B","v":"false","n":"HasClueAudio15"},{"t":"A","v":"answers_15_hint","n":"ClueAudio15"},{"t":"B","v":"false","n":"HasClueAudio16"},{"t":"A","v":"answers_16_hint","n":"ClueAudio16"},{"t":"B","v":"false","n":"HasClueAudio17"},{"t":"A","v":"answers_17_hint","n":"ClueAudio17"},{"t":"B","v":"true","n":"HasFollowupAudio"},{"t":"A","v":"followup","n":"FollowupAudio","s":"Here's to you, noble rhymesters."},{"t":"B","v":"true","n":"HasOutroAudio"},{"t":"A","v":"outro","n":"OutroAudio","s":"A toast to the host with the most... me!"}]}
